        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are a little reaper</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Grass Reaper</i> is an active incremental/clicker game. When you cut one grass tile, you get one soul. It's simple and chill. But you have the power to do so much more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879530/extras/0c62e2e8fcb772c98ca44b1a05bdb7e6.poster.avif?t=1756703707\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879530/extras/0c62e2e8fcb772c98ca44b1a05bdb7e6.webm?t=1756703707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879530/extras/0c62e2e8fcb772c98ca44b1a05bdb7e6.mp4?t=1756703707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect souls to unlock your power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers several upgrades, allowing players to utilise their powers to destroy map tiles efficiently. Strike down lightning or set the ground on fire. You can reach hellish speeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879530/extras/4479956af9f88c606ddbef3dff3d226f.poster.avif?t=1756703707\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879530/extras/4479956af9f88c606ddbef3dff3d226f.webm?t=1756703707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879530/extras/4479956af9f88c606ddbef3dff3d226f.mp4?t=1756703707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reap Everything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All map objects are destructible. You can destroy every corner of the map, or try the endless mode for further upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879530/extras/abcd0afca1e067a6c1fbcee6628ed56a.poster.avif?t=1756703707\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879530/extras/abcd0afca1e067a6c1fbcee6628ed56a.webm?t=1756703707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879530/extras/abcd0afca1e067a6c1fbcee6628ed56a.mp4?t=1756703707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are a little reaper</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Grass Reaper</i> is an active incremental/clicker game. When you cut one grass tile, you get one soul. It's simple and chill. But you have the power to do so much more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879530/extras/0c62e2e8fcb772c98ca44b1a05bdb7e6.poster.avif?t=1756703707\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879530/extras/0c62e2e8fcb772c98ca44b1a05bdb7e6.webm?t=1756703707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879530/extras/0c62e2e8fcb772c98ca44b1a05bdb7e6.mp4?t=1756703707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect souls to unlock your power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers several upgrades, allowing players to utilise their powers to destroy map tiles efficiently. Strike down lightning or set the ground on fire. You can reach hellish speeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879530/extras/4479956af9f88c606ddbef3dff3d226f.poster.avif?t=1756703707\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879530/extras/4479956af9f88c606ddbef3dff3d226f.webm?t=1756703707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879530/extras/4479956af9f88c606ddbef3dff3d226f.mp4?t=1756703707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reap Everything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All map objects are destructible. You can destroy every corner of the map, or try the endless mode for further upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879530/extras/abcd0afca1e067a6c1fbcee6628ed56a.poster.avif?t=1756703707\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879530/extras/abcd0afca1e067a6c1fbcee6628ed56a.webm?t=1756703707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879530/extras/abcd0afca1e067a6c1fbcee6628ed56a.mp4?t=1756703707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
